message: >-
  If you use S1-Core in research, please cite this repository.
title: >-
  S1-Core: a System 1 Inference Model Harness
authors:
  - name: acbcore-labs
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-14"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/acbcore-labs/s1-core"
keywords:
  - system-1-inference
  - decision-models
  - llm-harness
  - calibration
  - conformal-prediction
  - auditability
  - jev
abstract: >-
  A deterministic control loop around System 1 (decision) models such as
  TypeSafe's Jev: declarative choice/score/noul question specs with
  compile-time validation, deterministic fact precomputation, wave-parallel
  execution, scale-invariant calibration and conformal admissibility gates,
  and a content-addressed, hash-chained audit ledger with byte-identical
  verdict replay. Python >= 3.14, zero dependencies.
